      "cooked": "<p>I just spent 10 minutes trying to find the topic in which one benefactor was planning on buying 20 copies of the new errata cards and mailing them out to 20 folks, but I couldn't find it (which just means that one of you will be able to find it instantly).&nbsp; I needed to find it because I just purchased a Mr. Chomps for my daughter and tossed in a set of errata cards while I was at it, so I no longer need my spot on that list.&nbsp; Wherever that list is, my name should be removed from it and one other lucky soul should be given the opportunity to benefit from the generous offer.</p>",
